# VOLT MOTORS - Luxury Automotive Dealership & Shopping Experience

Build a **world-class, modern automotive website** for **VOLT MOTORS** adhering strictly to the user's aesthetic guidelines:
- **Palette**: Black (`#050505`), Dark Charcoal (`#0D0D0D`), Electric Cyan (`#00E5FF`), White (`#FFFFFF`), Gray (`#9A9A9A`).
- **Design Language**: Minimal cards, large vehicle photography, thin borders, generous negative space, sleek typography (`Outfit` / `Plus Jakarta Sans` / `Space Grotesk`), subtle micro-animations (300-400ms), and zero excessive gimmicks.

---

## Architecture & Technical Stack

- **Core**: Semantic HTML5, Modular Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+), Vanilla CSS3 with clean CSS custom properties / Design Tokens.
- **Structure**:
  - `index.html`: Main single-page application structure with SEO meta tags, semantic markup, and accessible ARIA attributes.
  - `css/styles.css`: Complete design system tokens, responsive grid, glassmorphism navbar, card states, micro-interactions, modal overlays, and media queries.
  - `js/data.js`: Rich vehicle catalog (12+ luxury/performance cars with multi-angle photos, real specifications, categories, and pricing).
  - `js/app.js`: Core application logic (filter/search engine, dynamic rendering, configurator state, financing calculator, comparison tool, wishlist, carousel slider, number counter observer, test drive modal flow, toast notifications).
  - `assets/`: High-resolution automotive imagery and SVG icons.

