## Detailed Component Plan

### 1. Sticky Navigation Bar
- **Branding**: "VOLT MOTORS" with a sleek cyan accent marker.
- **Navigation Links**: Home, Cars (Inventory), New Arrivals, Configurator, Financing, Services, About.
- **Quick Action Bar**:
  - Search trigger icon
  - Wishlist icon with live badge counter
  - Compare icon with live badge counter
  - **"Book a Test Drive"** button (Cyan outline / accent style)
- **Behavior**: Transparent over the hero section; smoothly transforms to a dark charcoal blurred glass header (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px); background: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.85)`) on scroll. Mobile responsive hamburger drawer.

### 2. Cinematic Hero Section
- **Visual**: Large cinematic dark-studio luxury vehicle background with vignette lighting.
- **Headline**: "DRIVE WHAT MOVES YOU."
- **Subheading**: "Discover exceptional vehicles built for performance, comfort and unforgettable journeys."
- **CTAs**: `EXPLORE CARS` (smooth scrolls to inventory) & `BOOK A TEST DRIVE` (opens interactive booking modal).
- **Subtle Load Animations**:
  - Smooth 600ms image fade-in.
  - Subtle upward title slide.
  - Expanding cyan accent line.
  - Elegant `SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓` floating indicator.

### 3. Performance Showcase ("ENGINEERED TO PERFORM")
- Clean dark highlight section with 3 large metrics:
  - **503 HP** (Power)
  - **650 Nm** (Torque)
  - **3.4 SEC** (0–100 km/h)
- Viewport intersection-triggered smooth counter animation (counts up from 0 when scrolled into view).

### 4. Interactive Search & Multi-Filter Inventory ("FIND YOUR NEXT CAR")
- **Live Search**: Instant keyword search (make, model, keyword).
- **Multi-Filter Controls**:
  - **Brand**: All, BMW, Porsche, Mercedes-AMG, Audi, Tesla, Lucid, Aston Martin, Ferrari.
  - **Body Type**: All, SUV, Sedan, Sports, Electric, Luxury.
  - **Fuel**: All, Petrol, Electric, Hybrid.
  - **Price Range**: Interactive slider ($40,000 – $350,000+).
  - **Year & Transmission** filters.
  - **Sort By**: Featured, Price (Low-to-High / High-to-Low), Power (HP), 0-100 km/h acceleration.
- **Dynamic Transition**: Smooth fade/slide when cards filter in and out. Active filter pills with instant clear.

### 5. Featured Vehicles Grid & Vehicle Cards
- **Grid Display**: Clean responsive 3-column / 2-column / 1-column layout.
- **Card Elements**: High-res vehicle photography, brand, model name, year, price, key specs pills (HP, Fuel, Transmission, 0-100 time).
- **Card Hover**: 3-5% image zoom, subtle card lift (-4px), thin cyan border glow transition, CTA arrow slide.
- **Quick Actions**:
  - Heart icon (Wishlist toggle with toast feedback).
  - Compare checkbox (Adds to floating comparison dock).
  - `VIEW DETAILS →` button (Opens comprehensive Vehicle Detail view).

### 6. Dedicated Vehicle Detail View & Image Gallery Modal
- **Layout**: Large vehicle image on left with selectable multi-angle thumbnail gallery; full specifications and purchase options on right.
- **Interactive Gallery**: Clicking thumbnails smoothly cross-fades main picture; active thumbnail gets cyan border.
- **Specs & Actions**:
  - Make, model, price, full performance breakdown.
  - `BOOK A TEST DRIVE` (auto-selects this car in booking form).
  - `ADD TO COMPARE` & `♡ SAVE TO WISHLIST`.
  - Detailed spec breakdown tabs (Performance, Powertrain, Interior & Tech, Safety).

### 7. Explore by Category
- Visual category cards: **SUV**, **SEDAN**, **SPORTS**, **ELECTRIC**, **LUXURY**.
- High-res vehicle imagery, dark gradient overlay, category title, active count.
- Hover: Subtle image zoom, dark overlay softens, title lifts, cyan arrow appears.
- Click action: Instantly filters the main inventory to the selected category and smoothly scrolls to the inventory.

### 8. New Arrivals Carousel
- Horizontal smooth carousel with drag, touch swipe, and arrow navigation buttons.
- Features newest additions to the showroom with a synchronized bottom progress indicator bar.

### 9. Interactive "Build Your Car" Studio Configurator
- Interactive vehicle customizer for a flagship model (e.g. BMW M4 Competition / Porsche 911 GT3).
- **Customization Options**:
  - **Exterior Color**: Obsidian Black, Frozen Cyan, Alpine White, Daytona Grey, Isle of Man Green.
  - **Wheels**: 20" M Forged Graphite, 21" Aero Carbon, 20" Multi-Spoke Gloss Black.
  - **Interior**: Black Merino Leather, Silverstone & Cyan Stitching, Kyalami Orange Carbon.
  - **Packages**: Standard, M Carbon Track Pack (+$8,500), Executive Luxury Package (+$5,200).
- **Real-time Updates**: Exterior car image/finish updates, live total price recalculation with animated number counter, and "Save Configuration" / "Book Test Drive With This Spec" buttons.

### 10. Financing Calculator ("MAKE IT YOURS")
- Interactive inputs:
  - Vehicle Price slider ($40,000 - $300,000)
  - Down Payment slider ($0 - $100,000)
  - Loan Term (24, 36, 48, 60, 72 months)
  - Interest Rate slider (2.9% - 9.9%)
- **Dynamic Calculation**: Real-time animated calculation of **Estimated Monthly Payment**, Total Interest, and Total Loan Amount.
- CTA: `GET FINANCING OPTIONS` (opens pre-qualification modal).

### 11. Test Drive CTA Banner ("SEE IT. DRIVE IT. FEEL IT.")
- Wide cinematic section with subtle background parallax/zoom and `BOOK A TEST DRIVE →` CTA.

### 12. Customer Reviews & Testimonials
- Minimal 5-star review carousel with verified buyer badges, buyer names, and purchased vehicle models.

### 13. "Why VOLT MOTORS" Value Proposition
- 4 clean feature blocks with minimal line icons and subtle cyan hover animations:
  1. **QUALITY CHECKED** (Every vehicle carefully inspected)
  2. **WIDE SELECTION** (Premium vehicles across multiple categories)
  3. **FLEXIBLE FINANCING** (Tailored financing solutions)
  4. **AFTER-SALES SUPPORT** (Dedicated support beyond the purchase)

### 14. Floating Compare Dock & Side-by-Side Comparison Modal
- Floating bottom dock appears when 2-4 cars are selected for comparison.
- Full side-by-side comparison modal comparing technical specs, pricing, performance, and features.

### 15. Wishlist Drawer
- Side slide-out drawer showing saved cars with instant removal or direct test drive booking.

### 16. Test Drive Booking Modal
- Clean, multi-step booking modal:
  - Vehicle selection (pre-filled if clicked from a specific car).
  - Date & Time slot picker.
  - Showroom Location or At-Home Delivery Test Drive option.
  - Contact information with instant confirmation screen and booking reference ID.

### 17. Premium Footer
- Brand logo, quick links, opening hours, contact details, social links, newsletter signup with instant feedback, and a subtle cyan accent line.

